        "seo_content": "<h2>Electric Scooters</h2><p>Shop <a href=\"https://ecombio.com/collections/electric-scooters\">electric scooters</a> for commuting, recreational rides, mixed-terrain routes, performance-focused travel, youth riders, and everyday personal electric mobility. Compare models by range, speed capability, motor setup, portability, suspension, tire type, braking system, rider weight capacity, folding design, lighting, and overall ride comfort.</p><h2>Types of Electric Scooters</h2><ul><li><a href=\"https://ecombio.com/collections/commuter-electric-scooters\">Commuter Electric Scooters</a> — A practical choice for daily rides, campus travel, last-mile trips, city errands, and everyday transportation.</li><li><a href=\"https://ecombio.com/collections/off-road-electric-scooters\">Off-Road Electric Scooters</a> — Good for riders who want more capability for rough pavement, gravel paths, hills, and mixed outdoor routes.</li><li><a href=\"https://ecombio.com/collections/performance-electric-scooters\">Performance Electric Scooters</a> — Built for riders comparing stronger acceleration, higher speed potential, longer rides, upgraded braking, and advanced suspension.</li><li><a href=\"https://ecombio.com/collections/electric-scooter-for-kids\">Electric Scooters for Kids</a> — Helpful for families comparing kid, youth, and teen-friendly scooters by age fit, speed range, portability, lighting, and rider limits.</li></ul><h2>More Ways to Shop with Us</h2><p>Start with your main riding need: daily commuting, mixed-terrain riding, higher-performance travel, or a scooter for a younger rider. From there, compare motor power, estimated range, top speed, scooter weight, folded size, tire type, suspension, braking system, deck space, lighting, charging time, and supported rider weight.</p><p>For a deeper breakdown, read our <a href=\"https://ecombio.com/blogs/news/how-to-choose-an-electric-scooter\">How to Choose an Electric Scooter</a> guide, compare tire options in our <a href=\"https://ecombio.com/blogs/news/electric-scooter-tire-guide\">Electric Scooter Tire Guide</a>, or learn how real-world range works in our <a href=\"https://ecombio.com/blogs/news/electric-scooter-range-guide\">Electric Scooter Range Guide</a>.</p>",
